   "id": "Ini hanya pratinjau agar Anda bisa mencoba langsung tanpa instalasi: edit basics.py di bawah, lalu klik Jalankan tes. Bagian B memakai fungsi (def), yang diajarkan Pelajaran 5. Python berjalan di komputer Anda (WebAssembly); tidak ada yang dikirim ke server. Yang dihitung adalah mengerjakannya di terminal Anda sendiri dengan pytest, tanpa menyalin kodenya, lalu python3 scripts/prove.py mod-0-0.",
   "en": "This is only a preview so you can try the lab right away with nothing installed: edit basics.py below, then click Run tests. Part B uses functions (def), which Lesson 5 teaches. Python runs on your own computer (WebAssembly); nothing is sent to a server. What counts is doing it in your own terminal with pytest, without copying the code, then python3 scripts/prove.py mod-0-0."
